Subject: [PATCH] Select the local AIOS engine at runtime

Applied by hybrid/build.sh to a temporary copy of backend/ plus gemma/java.
The Rezoss AI settings app chooses Gemma 4 E2B (LiteRT, GPU or CPU) or Qwen3:
the QNN V73 runner on SM8550, the Rezoss AI llama.cpp engine elsewhere.
API routes, Samsung IPC, output validation and deadlines are unchanged.

